// R2784000: the signature animation of every Stinkyscape+ card (docs/polish/9-card-animations.md).
// One line per catalog card, tokens included, in catalog order, its name in a comment after it
// (tables.test.ts holds the file to the catalog). An entry is one of:
//   "none: <reason>"                        the card's event rows alone ("none: pending" until its set's pass);
//   { bespoke: "<recipe>" }                 its own recipe (fx/cards/bespoke.ts), drawn in fx/cards/<set>/;
//   { setPiece: "<key>" }                   a board clear's set piece (fx/setPieces.ts), held for one beat (R2800000);
//   { <hook>: { motif, palette?, row? } }   a shared motif (fx/motifs/names.ts) on a hook.
//   { aura: { look, palette?, scope } }     a standing look while it holds, alone or beside hooks (fx/aura/looks.ts, R2787000),
//                                           or beside a bespoke; a Unit's on its own `tile` (R3400000).
//   + entrance: "<key>"                     beside any entry but "none", or alone: a Unit's or a Field Spell's entrance (fx/entrances.ts, R3332000);
//   + takeover: "<look>", signature: true   a Mythic's own takeover look (fx/takeover.ts); a Legendary's or Mythic's signature (R3332000).
// Hooks: `cast` (a non-Unit's play) and `cry` (a Unit's) play as the card resolves; `death`, `trigger` and
// `activate` play from the hook's own `hookResolving` marker (R2797000). `palette` is a flavor's look (the
// card's own flavor by default); `row` is "replace" (the default: the motif draws the numbers in place of
// the event's own recipe) or "keep" (it plays over that recipe). Filled at the set's release (issue #3596)
// from the shipped sets' choices for cards that do the same: shared motifs and looks only, no recipe or
// set piece of its own, every Legendary and Mythic on signature.test.ts's SIGNATURE_PENDING until its
// set's signature pass. A Burn or a Toxic is a counter (`counterChanged`), which `tally` reads.
{
  "stinkyscapeplus-001": { cast: { motif: "bolt" } }, // Starfruit
  "stinkyscapeplus-002": "none: its Evolve runs from the state check, which no hookResolving marks; the evolve row draws it", // Lone Drifter
  "stinkyscapeplus-003": { cry: { motif: "bless", palette: "Beast/swarm" } }, // High Evolutionary
  "stinkyscapeplus-004": { cry: { motif: "vanish", palette: "Beast/felinor" }, activate: { motif: "hex", palette: "Beast/felinor" } }, // Profe Yates
  "stinkyscapeplus-005": { cry: { motif: "deal", palette: "Snack" } }, // Dingleberry Droat
  "stinkyscapeplus-006": { trigger: { motif: "send", palette: "Snack" } }, // Wines McCheese
  "stinkyscapeplus-006-1": "none: token; its own play is its Tipsy, and its fusing a hand trigger no hookResolving marks", // Fine Fermented Grape
